  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient Infrastructure Portfolio</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Led by UNDP, the Resilient Infrastructure Portfolio enhances access to affordable, sustainable housing and strengthens the resilience of public health clinics and schools in Mozambique. By promoting resilient health, education, and rural housing infrastructure through sustainable construction and maintenance, it ensures long-term durability, affordability, and climate adaptation. The initiative fosters innovative building techniques, capacity-building, and policy advocacy, improving the quality and accessibility of essential services. It aligns with Mozambique&#x2019;s National Development Strategy (2025-2044) by addressing infrastructure vulnerabilities, supporting economic growth, and promoting inclusive and climate-resilient development. Through multi-stakeholder partnerships, it drives investment in sustainable infrastructure solutions, ensuring better living conditions, economic opportunities, and social equity for communities.</narrative>
  </description>
